From 70c3e78f695a8ecf64a74e985be6f40ddd81c0e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stoatium Build <stoatium@localhost>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 17:07:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat: resolve instance URL at runtime

Adds a persisted `serverUrl` config key and resolves the target instance
lazily, so a single build can point at any self-hosted instance.

Precedence: --force-server (persisted on use) > stored serverUrl >
STOATIUM_SERVER_URL baked in at build time.

Resolution must stay lazy: native/config.ts imports mainWindow from
native/window.ts, so reading config at window.ts module scope hits the
TDZ on `export const config`.
